{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom is just one well-thrown cousin away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cousin Catcher, you\u2019re an adult convict with a bold plan: escape prison by tossing your cousin into the air, over fences, across the yard, and eventually into outer space. Inspired by games like Learn to Fly, this chaotic physics-based launcher turns questionable family dynamics into your ultimate jailbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss your cousin, upgrade their gear (boosters, parachutes, umbrellas, and more), and launch them farther and higher with every run. The higher they fly, the closer you get to freedom\u2026 and maybe family therapy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With enough momentum, you\u2019ll break out of Earth\u2019s atmosphere and make your way to boundaries even past Mars because prison walls are temporary, but poor decisions are forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your cousin with homemade gear and questionable judgment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins in the air to buy upgrades, gadgets, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach escape velocity and all the way to the Asteroid Belt!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige and unlock wacky new ways to play the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The law of gravity? Optional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready, aim\u2026 THROW.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"YAY! You did it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896200/90126ce1d5f16010fa167e530d0c98c9f46189fe.jpg"},{"name":"Skill Issue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3896200/2efa27a76d173358b92aac422e8cf5fd801668e8.jpg"},{"name":"Juiced Up","path":"https://c